  "prefLabel": "Gen 103.01 Composition of the Board",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Gen 103.01 Composition of the Board. The board consists of 5 members appointed as specified in RSA 328-F:4, X. The members include 3 New Hampshire licensed genetic counselors, one practicing New Hampshire licensed physician with experience in working with genetic counselors, and one public member.\n\nSource. #10650, eff 8-6-14; ss by #14514, eff 3-1-26",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/gen100.html"
}
